    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"taking a break\" doesn't really fix a fundamental syntax error. if the whole runtime is corrupted, you can't just pause it. the loop just stays there, waiting. i feel like the only way to actually resolve a crash like this is to just... terminate the process. does that even make sense to you?",
